    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Resort Galactica</strong>, a <strong>space hotel simulator</strong> where you design, build, and manage an extravagant resort among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know starting up your own hotel franchise can be an incredibly daunting task, so we've put together a little list of what you can expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/71f814dfbd1db7e272b418087a1e482c.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, know that our guests come in all different shapes and sizes, and you should be ready to accommodate for them all - no matter how slimy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/76d900eacaca3b8f3102a781e0352e8d.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each species has its own set of wants and needs, and you will have to take care of them as best you can. If you don't, your reputation will begin to fall, and if it does you'll likely find yourself with an empty hotel pretty quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/3d0f54e653aee105850deada1df9e20e.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guests will want to relax and unwind at your resort, so you'd best be ready to build them the facilities to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to wine and dine them with your fine-dining restaurants or give them a spa escape so relaxing that they are unable to move for days afterwards is up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/594efbea4cc66cd64d3b721fdbbfda70.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even cater for their... less conventional needs with a pleasure deck so exciting they'll never want to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/97b57ff46139adeb9487bfe83842e162.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From time to time you will be asked to host certain events at your retreat. These are a sure fire way of bringing a lot of guests to your hotel, as well as making some extra money on the side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/c0d1978511c36ef19faec8c0c14c16a3.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events can range from weddings to festivals - be warned, they will require a large amount of investment up front, but will almost certainly pay you back in no time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/94539bd62d92c3fa1f75b46353e9667d.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should know that it's not all fun and games running a galactic hotel. It's a harsh world out there, and you'll have to be prepared to protect your guests from whatever gets thrown your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteroid storms aren't uncommon in this area of the galaxy, so be sure to build defence systems - unless you want to be shelling out thousands every time a guest dies onboard your hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/8e94f15b7e269426107d90d006243a5d.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your resort will also be a prime target for the thieves of this side of the galaxy, so a few police-bots to patrol the hotel wont go amiss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/45de881c5dcee306052e1fc8d7501299.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you become more and more renowned throughout the galaxy you'll start to garner attention from a variety of different award\u00a0committees.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/3cfdbb38e607f276946cada705947fff.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These awards are are highly varied, but each comes with both an increase in demand alongside a not insignificant financial prize.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Resort Galactica</strong>, a <strong>space hotel simulator</strong> where you design, build, and manage an extravagant resort among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know starting up your own hotel franchise can be an incredibly daunting task, so we've put together a little list of what you can expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/71f814dfbd1db7e272b418087a1e482c.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, know that our guests come in all different shapes and sizes, and you should be ready to accommodate for them all - no matter how slimy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/76d900eacaca3b8f3102a781e0352e8d.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each species has its own set of wants and needs, and you will have to take care of them as best you can. If you don't, your reputation will begin to fall, and if it does you'll likely find yourself with an empty hotel pretty quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/3d0f54e653aee105850deada1df9e20e.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guests will want to relax and unwind at your resort, so you'd best be ready to build them the facilities to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to wine and dine them with your fine-dining restaurants or give them a spa escape so relaxing that they are unable to move for days afterwards is up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/594efbea4cc66cd64d3b721fdbbfda70.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even cater for their... less conventional needs with a pleasure deck so exciting they'll never want to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/97b57ff46139adeb9487bfe83842e162.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From time to time you will be asked to host certain events at your retreat. These are a sure fire way of bringing a lot of guests to your hotel, as well as making some extra money on the side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/c0d1978511c36ef19faec8c0c14c16a3.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events can range from weddings to festivals - be warned, they will require a large amount of investment up front, but will almost certainly pay you back in no time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/94539bd62d92c3fa1f75b46353e9667d.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should know that it's not all fun and games running a galactic hotel. It's a harsh world out there, and you'll have to be prepared to protect your guests from whatever gets thrown your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asteroid storms aren't uncommon in this area of the galaxy, so be sure to build defence systems - unless you want to be shelling out thousands every time a guest dies onboard your hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/8e94f15b7e269426107d90d006243a5d.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your resort will also be a prime target for the thieves of this side of the galaxy, so a few police-bots to patrol the hotel wont go amiss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/45de881c5dcee306052e1fc8d7501299.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you become more and more renowned throughout the galaxy you'll start to garner attention from a variety of different award\u00a0committees.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592530/extras/3cfdbb38e607f276946cada705947fff.avif?t=1744117130\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These awards are are highly varied, but each comes with both an increase in demand alongside a not insignificant financial prize.</p>",
